# Deploy the board as plain static files — no serverless functions.
#
# Vercel gives a function no memory that survives between requests, so with
# api/ deployed but no Redis attached the score lives in one instance's memory
# and quietly reverts when the next request lands somewhere else. Each browser
# keeping its own copy is both simpler and more reliable.
#
# To turn the API back on (all screens sharing one score): delete this file,
# attach Upstash Redis under Storage, and set SCOREBOARD_PASSWORD.
api/
